WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:07.270
A man in blue full-body tights was just caught in a
series of car crashes with a trailer on a highway. He died.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.070
As for the other casualties...

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.740
That was quite a dreadful accident.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.950
Anyway, it's fun to watch TV.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.160
I love watching TV, too.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.660
Oh, K1 starts at 7 and I forgot to record it.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.250
You don't even have a recorder to begin with.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.000
It's starting!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:26.750
Buy me one.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.840
No.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.180
I'm back.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.310
No one's home?

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.900
Hello? This is the Emiya residence.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.110
Ahh, is this Tohsaka?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.400
Huh? Emiya-kun?

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.070
Sorry, I'd like you to do me a favor.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.370
Why are you in such a panic?

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.580
They suddenly put me on a shift at work.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.410
I'd like you to help me record something on TV.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.790
Record?

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.290
It's the 7 o'clock show on Fuji TV.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:36.300
Let's see... 7 o'clock on Fuji TV...

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:39.090
This K1-thingymabob show?

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.640
Guys sure love stuff like this.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.180
Why do you care?!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.010
I have to go, so I'm hanging up.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.640
You just need to power it on and press the record button.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.940
I'm sorry, but I'm counting on you.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.940
Yeah, yeah. No problem at all.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.520
Have fun at work!

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:57.900
Now...

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:06.160
Just power it on and press the record button.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.290
Just power it on and press...

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.670
...the record button.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:11.960
Power it on...

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.550
This isn't a videotape recorder!

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.300
No way...

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:20.090
Is this the rumored MegaDisc?!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.050
It's a Bluray recorder, Rin.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.350
Ow!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.600
Stop stepping on me to hide your embarrassment!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.270
You're bad with handling machines, right?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.440
I was thinking of helping you if you'd like...

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.940
Mind your own business!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.860
I can record a show by myself just fine!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.280
Allow me to observe, then.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.320
Just calm down.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:48.490
As a member of the Tohsaka family, I must always be elegant.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.210
Right! I need to see if there's a disc inside or not first!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.960
It's possible that Shirou accidentally forgot to put one in!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.210
No way!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.050
There really is no disc! Shirou, you dummy!

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.430
What should I do?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.850
Can I record over one of these lying around?

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.260
But I shouldn't be looking at someone else's stuff without permission!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.730
I didn't know Emiya-kun liked S&M stuff!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.490
A-Archer.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:26.910
Since you're a guy, which titles do you think could be a camouflage?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.950
Camouflage? I don't get what you're talking about...

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.580
But you're running out of time.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.410
You should hurry up.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.120
Geez!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.880
I don't care if it's a porn video or whatever anymore!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.550
Spidermaso! You're it!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.930
S-So how do I play the video?

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.680
I-I have to choose between "hard disk" and "Bluray"? What's that?!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.890
I pressed a strange button!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.730
I hope it won't blow up or something...

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.520
Wh-Which is the rewind button?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.900
Is there enough space?!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.150
No, I can't take this anymore!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.730
It's all Shirou's fault!

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.820
It's because he didn't put a blank Bluray disc in!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.240
It's about time.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.320
Rin.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.080
There's one thing you got wrong.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:14.620
Bluray recorders don't need a disc to record something.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.630
The data gets recorded to the hard disk inside.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.590
You then burn the data onto a Bluray disc.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.960
Do you remember what Emiya Shirou said?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.340
You just have to press the record button...

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.390
White Moon Princess Phantasmoon!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.100
I won't tolerate evil!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.480
Tohsaka, you got the wrong channel!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.640
Just as expected!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.980
Identity crisis.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.700
Explosion endings are just terrible!

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.820
Ugh, another bad end?

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.280
The choices are too difficult.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:54.620
It doesn't look like happy ends are easy to achieve.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.210
Just like real life.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.000
So is happiness far away?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.130
Far away, indeed.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.300
You can keep wallowing in the misfortune you were born into.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.710
Oh, what is love?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.920
We have a story about love today.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.890
Why...

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.430
did this...

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:19.150
have to happen?!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.110
Okay!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.230
Aren't guys just really stupid?

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.530
If they can't solve their problems by themselves,

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.030
why don't we let the two useless
protagonists struggle together next time?

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.720
I can't believe all my dates are clashing...

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.930
It's your fault for being so unfaithful!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.010
But Shirou-kun, your dates are clashing too.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.430
I just want to make everyone happy!

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.350
Don't give me that crap.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.730
I'm serious!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.570
But isn't your girl a king?

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.940
Won't she kill you?

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.690
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.610
She might. But...!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.490
If death could solve this, I wouldn't mind dying.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:18.580
But I'm sure there's something worse than dying in store for me.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.250
I'll kill you!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.170
That's way too scary, man.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.290
Yeah. She's a True Ancestor, after all.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.420
That's why!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:34.680
We've got to come up with a timetable to avoid getting killed!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.140
It's done.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.350
Incredible.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.400
Start by getting up at 5... I mean, 4.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.020
So early!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.440
I'll start with my promise with Kohaku-san early morning.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.610
At the same time, I'll also begin fixing the
roof with Hisui early morning, as promised.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.860
What? Is that even possible?!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.570
I'll <i>make</i> it possible.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.280
Otherwise I'll get killed.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.330
I'll disappear on Hisui saying I need to fetch a stepladder.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.420
As for Kohaku-san, I'll use an escape hole prepared in advance.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:07.040
I feel bad, but Kohaku-san will keep waiting for me
obliviously in front of the capsule after I've escaped.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.840
What a plan... You must be a genius!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.300
It gets even better.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.680
I'll take Arcueid to the movies and pretend to go to the bathroom.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.140
I'll use that time to meet up with Senpai at a curry buffet.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.600
What about the little sister you left behind at the amusement park?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.520
I'll show up two hours later only to get lost like the last time.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.190
Incredible! What flawless logic!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.020
I know, right?

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.230
Everyone knows people get lost in amusement parks.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.320
I can totally see that.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.360
You've got to be a devil.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.860
You're pretty devilish yourself.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.280
Making this Sakura girl go home at noon...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.410
Way too innovative.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.200
Sakura will understand!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:43.370
I just want everyone to be happy!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.750
A restaurant happens to be hosting an all-you-can-eat buffet that day.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.380
I'll take Saber there.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.880
You can't make her stay at a restaurant for five hours.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.260
You're not some scriptwriter facing a deadline around the corner.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.890
Saber's constantly hungry.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:57.600
Not bad at all!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.010
Meanwhile, I'll go shopping with Tohsaka at the department store.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.680
Which is at the same area as the buffet!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.430
Ingenious!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.140
And we'll all have dinner together at night!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:04.890
Together?!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:05.980
Women are demons, man!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.230
How naïve can you get?!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.480
They're all really great girls!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:09.570
They'll understand!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.980
Y-Yeah...

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.320
We're doing this with the best intentions at heart.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.200
That's right!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.950
Alright, we've got this!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.320
Yeah, we've got it!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.750
Hey. Isn't this kinda...

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.710
...impossible?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.710
We're screwed!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.420
Totally!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.170
Aren't they such jerks?

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.420
I don't think it'll go well no matter what we do.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.050
What should we do, then?!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.260
What <i>can</i> we do?!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.970
Must we prepare for the worst?!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.220
In that case...

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.600
Your one vote can change their future!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.600
Cast your vote on the internet at this website.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.450
Women are so much trouble.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.410
That's what's cute about them, though.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.200
Ugh, I made the wrong choice.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.410
Just like my real life.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.250
Next section coming up.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.090
Here I go!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.630
Magic Circuit Fullcount!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:22.560
Extreme High Jump!

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.220
Marble Phantasm!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.400
This really can't be happening!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.650
The demon Akiha, an incarnation of envy and grumpiness,

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.660
actually fed an abandoned dog in the rain!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.780
She's so scary! So gross!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.200
And the unexpected ally who appeared then...

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.160
Ren, what's that Daikon radish for?!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.040
Next, on White Princess Phantasmoon:

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.790
Combustible Trash Day!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:58.380
I'll Marble Phantasm your heart next time, too!

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.510
Okay, okay, okay!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.230
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:13.810
Okay! I'm sure you're all familiar with the Afterschool Alleyway Alliance by now.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.770
Please don't forget to tell your friends, too!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.070
That's because we have no friends.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.780
You guys don't have friends either, right?

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.450
Stop that! You shouldn't point at the audience!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.120
Seriously, right?

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:24.450
Stop it!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.160
Don't say things like that to the audience!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.330
Nobody having friends was within my calculations.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.960
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.840
Let's move on!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.920
The health craze is still going strong...

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.340
Having friends is a pain, anyway.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.380
That again?!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.130
That was also within my calculations.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.680
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.560
Anyway, you guys know about this?

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.440
Marriages between people with large age gaps...

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.020
Friends will betray you!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.820
That's not a problem, for it is within my calculations.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.190
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.530
Man, they liked it!

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.450
We're getting so much applause!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.790
I'm so glad we didn't give up!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.750
No, something's wrong.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.210
My calculations were incorrect.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.290
Wait...

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.170
Quit dreaming! We're breaking up!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.630
What?!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.270
This is the real thing.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.600
Next episode preview!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.020
Humans are multimedia.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.980
Once again, the Tiger Dojo...

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.020
begins now!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.110
Yes, Instructor!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.030
We've received this many complaint letters from our old fans!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.400
Thank you for the letters.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:08.610
Now burn them all!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.450
W-Wait just one second!

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.240
You won't grow as a person if you don't reflect on your actions!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.370
Don't look back. Don't reflect on your actions!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.580
Reflecting on your actions won't fill your belly!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.210
I won't have any desires until I win!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.000
W-Win what?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.960
W-Well, ladies and gentlemen.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:26.380
Much has happened, but thank you all for watching until the end!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:30.010
Season two, hup! Season two, hup!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.390
Bye-bye!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.640
See you again!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:33.810
We're doing more of this?
